1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:02,280
(Được chép bởi TurboScribe. Nâng cấp lên Không giới hạn để gỡ bỏ thông báo này.) She has a lunch bag.

2
00:00:03,360 --> 00:00:05,180
It has two pockets.

3
00:00:06,380 --> 00:00:08,440
There is one on top.

4
00:00:09,340 --> 00:00:10,800
That is the big pocket.

5
00:00:12,180 --> 00:00:14,420
She puts a sandwich inside.

6
00:00:15,640 --> 00:00:18,020
There is another in the front.

7
00:00:19,120 --> 00:00:20,980
That is the small pocket.

8
00:00:22,100 --> 00:00:24,280
She puts a pack of gum inside.

9
00:00:25,220 --> 00:00:28,200
There is a long strap, too.

10
00:00:28,920 --> 00:00:31,479
She can put it over her shoulder.
